{"agent_id":"pp3g-aco1-exp7-t4-semantic-audit-packet-zero-api-calls-read-01bc","agent_seq":3,"timestamp":"2026-09-29T14:46:36.743400378Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"4ce2b6fe-caab-4f53-9a26-d55b1dcabc0e","comment_uuid":"c08eefbe-4aa5-41c4-9d00-5bc452f08c2d","author":"pp3g-aco1-exp7-t4-semantic-audit-packet-zero-api-calls-read-01bc","content":"Plan: Exp7 §H independent semantic audit packet (read-only, zero API calls).\n\n## Scope\nRead research/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/DESIGN.md §§C,D,H (frozen strategy packet), the frozen experiment7/packet.json, and experiment6/AUDIT-PAIRS.md (format precedent). Emit exactly one file: research/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/AUDIT-PAIRS.md. Nothing under experiment6/ or experiment7/ other than this one path is touched. Commit ONLY that path on #574.\n\n## Environment note (pre-existing, not a blocker)\nThis worktree is on feature/pp3g-aco1-exp7-t4-... @ 719223195 (= main HEAD), which does not contain the phase2 tree. The phase2 tree (experiment6/packet.json, experiment7/DESIGN.md, packet.json, REUSE-CHECK.md) lives on research/jev-phase1-565 @ 03f0c0f78, checked out in .worktrees/jev-phase1. Inputs are therefore read read-only via 'git show research/jev-phase1-565:<path>' (blob-identical). The deliverable is written to the same relative path here and committed on this feature branch, matching the precedent set by the T-recon agent (f426dae65). Merging into research/jev-phase1-565 is operator-gated and is reported, not performed.\n\n## Method (deterministic, stdlib only, zero network)\n1. Parse frozen experiment7/packet.json read-only. Assert counts (48 rows / 24 pairs / 8-8-8 / api_calls_spent 0) before anything else.\n2. Select 6 pairs = 2 per stratum, matching the exp6 two-per-class format precedent, and covering both required limitation classes: pd.pair00 (calendar over-approximation) and pd.pair03 (attribute receiver).\n3. Per pair, extract from the packet and render byte-exactly under the exp6 elision discipline: full state sha256 (U and A), the full header block, the full runtime-facts section, the full decisive line, and the END marker. Verbatim module source is elided and hash-pinned via the header's module_sha256.\n4. Re-derive the §D Noul proposition by substituting the pair's own question into the frozen instructions_template, and byte-check it against the packet's own request.questions.sufficiency.instructions.\n5. Show the one decisive RUNTIME_FACT difference as a U-vs-A line diff over the two states, and assert that the ONLY differing lines are the meta variant line and the decisive-fact line (exp6 semantic contract).\n6. Restate U-insufficient / A-sufficient against the Exp6 P2b compatible sets, and reproduce REUSE-CHECK.md section 6 limitation statuses VERBATIM.\n\n## Constraints honoured\nZERO network calls. No measured Jev call, no systemone call, no chat call. Read-only on experiment6/. No re-adjudication: verdicts are carried from Exp6, never re-derived. NO Noul wording invented - the §D proposition is copied from the frozen DESIGN and instantiated with the packet's own question. Commit ONLY experiment7/AUDIT-PAIRS.md.\n\n## Stop condition\nOn ANY concrete semantic-defect evidence: STOP, record the evidence, change nothing, do not repair. DESIGN section J.\n\n## Certainty\nPlan is evidence-based (all four input artifacts read and their structure mapped). NOT-TESTED: the semantic adequacy judgement itself is the deliverable, not an input; and no measured Jev value informs any statement here (zero calls by construction).","created_at":"2026-09-29T14:46:36.735976872Z","kind":"plan","signed_by":"SHA256:hdB73DsQ4mX/sxwh2kxLnz2D/24LuRGauFyGmrlfosc","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgEPjrdCP90JR8ko9r1U98DLTrZ0LJGJDZSMZN/pZlM+0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAw3xEyQ09PjsLa0EswZo7Dq2yhfhl9UM++TpMbLgJcB3/r3MUJJn+udCUp32YO6Zpp/+Ufn1PaVQsgPlZKm6UDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:hdB73Ds